{"step":2,"type":"command","purpose":"展示创建、筛选、更新、重复和非法输入，并观察 execute 响应的条件字段结构","command":"python3 checks/demo_breakpoints.py workflow 19226","displayStartedAt":"2026-10-02T19:29:15.894984+00:00","executedAt":"2026-10-02T19:29:17.869697+00:00","endedAt":"2026-10-02T19:29:18.230664+00:00","cwdBefore":"/mnt/d/ytask/task03/verification/evaluation-rounds/1/record/task03-002/b","cwdAfter":"/mnt/d/ytask/task03/verification/evaluation-rounds/1/record/task03-002/b","exitCode":1,"timedOut":false,"started":true,"processId":1430990,"processGroupId":1430990,"output":"\nREQUEST POST /v1/breakpoints\nBODY {\"address\": 4096, \"enabled\": true, \"kind\": \"execute\"}\nSTATUS 201\nRESPONSE {\"address\": 4096, \"enabled\": true, \"id\": 1, \"kind\": \"execute\", \"size\": null}\nCHECK PASS: execute breakpoint is created\nCHECK FAIL: execute response has exactly its normalized conditional fields\n\nREQUEST POST /v1/breakpoints\nBODY {\"address\": 8192, \"enabled\": false, \"kind\": \"read\", \"size\": 4}\nSTATUS 201\nRESPONSE {\"address\": 8192, \"enabled\": false, \"id\": 2, \"kind\": \"read\", \"size\": 4}\nCHECK PASS: watchpoint preserves size and receives the next id\n\nREQUEST GET /v1/breakpoints?kind=read&enabled=false\nSTATUS 200\nRESPONSE [{\"address\": 8192, \"enabled\": false, \"id\": 2, \"kind\": \"read\", \"size\": 4}]\nCHECK PASS: combined filters return the matching id-sorted record\n\nREQUEST PATCH /v1/breakpoints/2\nBODY {\"enabled\": true}\nSTATUS 200\nRESPONSE {\"address\": 8192, \"enabled\": true, \"id\": 2, \"kind\": \"read\", \"size\": 4}\nCHECK PASS: PATCH changes only enabled\n\nREQUEST POST /v1/breakpoints\nBODY {\"address\": 4096, \"enabled\": false, \"kind\": \"execute\"}\nSTATUS 409\nRESPONSE {\"error\": {\"code\": \"duplicate_breakpoint\", \"message\": \"a breakpoint with the same kind, address and size already exists\"}}\nCHECK PASS: duplicate detection ignores enabled\n\nREQUEST POST /v1/breakpoints\nBODY {\"address\": 4096, \"enabled\": false, \"kind\":